  "id": 975,
  "description": "# 🪓⛏️🎣 **welcome!** 🧪🔥🍖\nWe are a guild for Combat Level 1 Skillers only; masters of discipline whose hands remain untarnished by the stains of raid and combat.\n\n###### 🌊 Guild Mastery EXP + Guild EXP is earned solely through completing challenges. Let&#039;s be the first challenge-only guild to unlock the Energizing Pool 🌊\n\n\n## ✨️ __skill badge collection__\n\n# 🐕 ⛏️ ⛏️ ⛏️ 🔥 🪓 🪓 🪓 🎣 🎣 🎣 🎣 🍖 🍖 🍖 🍖 🍖 🏠\n\n- Badges collected: 18\n- Completionist progress: 7/22\n\n## 👑 __goals__\n- Level 70 Guild for Energizing Pool\n- Guild achievements list\n- Guild badge completionist status (collectively obtain every possible non-combat badge across all guild members)\n\n\n## 📝 __apply__\n\n- [x] ⚔️ Combat level 1\n- [x] 📊 200 Total level minimum\n- [x] 🎁 Contribute at least 500 items toward guild challenges within 1 week of joining\n###### Contribution to the stockpile is welcomed but not required\n\n\n## ⚠️ __please avoid__\n⚔️ Levelling-up your combat level\n\n###### Doing so will remove you from the guild\n\n🗡🤪 Applying when your combat level is 2 or higher, you silly clowns. Especially you combat pures! Booooo!\n\n## __note for banished/cursed classes__\n###### Happy to see your interest in applying to our guild, however you will be unable to participate in guild challenges &amp; stockpile due to your character&#039;s trade restrictions. Consider searching for a banished guild instead with fellow trade-locked classes. Cheers!",
